// Migrations directory
//
// Each file here is a versioned schema change applied to your database.
// Format: <YYYYMMDDHHMMSS>_<description>.sql
//
// Example:
//   20260419120000_create_orders_table.sql
//
// Apply locally:  supabase db push
// Reset locally:  supabase db reset
//
// Migrations are auto-generated by Chantan when the AI adds tables/columns.
// You can also write them by hand.
